ta-tip=\"Forecast said 11%&amp;#10;It rained 7% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 71 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"97.58816901408451\" cy=\"356.3661971830986\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 31%&amp;#10;It rained 18% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 72 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"166.65833333333336\" cy=\"316.27777777777777\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 49%&amp;#10;It rained 22% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 68 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"233.07382352941175\" cy=\"301.70588235294116\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 68%&amp;#10;It rained 35% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 77 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"299.5015584415585\" cy=\"254.36363636363637\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 85%&amp;#10;It rained 61% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 69 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"359.0539130434783\" cy=\"160.43478260869563\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 95%&amp;#10;It rained 67% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 75 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"395.62159999999994\" cy=\"139.33333333333334\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 100%&amp;#10;It rained 86% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 147 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"411.8555102040816\" cy=\"67.52380952380952\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(39%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Chengdu the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>autumn</b> (0.31) and least in\n<b>summer</b> (0.16).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>173</td><td class='num'>50%</td><td class='num'>0.160</td><td class='num'>17.8%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>172</td><td class='num'>20%</td><td class='num'>0.200</td><td class='num'>12.7%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>202</td><td class='num'>40%</td><td class='num'>0.239</td><td class='num'>16.2%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>176</td><td class='num'>47%</td><td class='num'>0.309</td><td class='num'>15.6%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":30.66667,"lon":104.06667,"n":723,"n_cities":216,"name":"Chengdu","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.05,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.009305555555555558,"n":144,"obs":0.020833333333333332,"sig":false},{"hi":0.22,"lo":0.05,"mean":0.11183098591549297,"n":71,"obs":0.07042253521126761,"sig":false},{"hi":0.41,"lo":0.22,"mean":0.30694444444444446,"n":72,"obs":0.18055555555555555,"sig":true},{